ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW -- Running calculation from the beginning
ROWS BETWEEN 2 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW -- Current + previous 2 rows
ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING -- Entire partition

